Package: linksy
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Linksy <https://github.com/LinkSy-mg/linksy-releases>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: linksy-common (= @VERSION@), libgtk-4-1 (>= 4.14), libadwaita-1-0 (>= 1.5), gstreamer1.0-gtk4
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/LinkSy-mg/linksy-releases
Description: Your devices, connected
 Linksy connects your computer and phone directly over your own network, with no
 account, cloud or server: send files and your clipboard, see and control another
 device's screen, use a tablet as a second display, or a phone as a webcam.
 .
 This is the GTK app, for GNOME and most desktops; linksy-qt is the one for KDE Plasma.
